sequenceDiagram
%% Diagrama de secuencia: agregar evento a favoritos - Norma 220501095
actor U as Usuario
participant Card as EventCard.tsx
participant Mut as useToggleFavoriteMutation
participant Svc as favoriteService
participant API as POST /favorites/:eventId
participant DB as PostgreSQL

U->>Card: clic en corazón
Card->>Mut: mutate({eventId, isFavorite=false})
Mut->>Card: estado optimista (corazón lleno)
Mut->>Svc: add(eventId)
Svc->>API: POST /favorites/:id + JWT
API->>DB: INSERT INTO favorites
DB-->>API: 201 Created
API-->>Svc: Favorite
Svc-->>Mut: éxito
Mut->>Card: toast "guardado en favoritos"
Mut->>Card: invalida query [favorites]
Card->>U: lista actualizada
